  "body": "The new authenticated COPY-only image now installs the exact verified ABI0 SDK8d302ae2/992200bytes. Saved image SHA4984470cd7d732f9f2d1c12710c9433b563b3817ba6d1d419749a9a2b1b46698 contains the original ten base layers plus one SDK-only layer; the full44,232-file/link manifest matches the expected single SDK replacement. Independent owner inspection reads the installed SDK itself and21providers from the archive: zero root strong misses, three weak imports, identical prior provider identities.\n\nNew one-use request03 binds reviewed source5c7c1ab, request-only activation7cf0f01, workflow419021681/run43700449423/attempt1/successful produce job132770205181, exact source CI and live artifact digests. Production and independent acceptance succeeded. Source/run/job/API/ZIP/archive/manifest/SDK payload checks precede the origin flag;16fixed Docker commands and before/aftercreated/RunningFalse/Pid0 snapshots confirm the authorized COPY-only path. This is TLS GitHub API lineage, not signature or independent reproducible-build attestation.\n\nValidation:17focused tests; full1,629 tests (1,622pass/7skip); sole fresh review0Critical/0Important/1Minor. DeferredM1: early credential initialization failure can leave an empty output directory without failure receipt; failsclosed/diagnostics only. No fixpass/rereview/minor polishing. All232source-closure files remain exactly the production source. Preserves6,379basefiles/299pins/10originals/main/Drafts102\u2013116/8nativehistories/oldimage0276/oldconsumed01/02; request03 is now consumed once.\n\n105conservative version-library diagnostics remain; full dependency closure, object ABI, mapping, early install, lifetimes, driver/sink and scientific behavior remain unqualified. No actual SDK/Panda/GL/MetaDrive/model/officialORT/loader calls or container starts, registry/Cloud publication or main/shared-base update/merge. Nativeallowance0/strict0of4FAIL/Stage7INCOMPLETE.\n\nReview docs/STAGE7_PANDA_SDK_ABI0_IMAGE_RESULT.md, docs/S